# Python

- Each service has its own dependency file. There is no repository-wide `requirements.txt`.
- Pin direct dependencies.
- Type public functions.
- Raise specific exceptions and do not swallow them.
- Library code and nodes do not call `print()`. ROS 2 nodes log through `rclpy`.
- `webrtc-client-go` and `capture-pipeline` do not import `rclpy` or any other ROS 2 package.
